AND (všetky slová musia byť v dokumente, v ľubovoľných poliach):

ferrari AND monaco
female AND british
motorcycle AND champion

OR (stačí jedno slovo):

ferrari OR maserati
senna OR prost OR lauda
hamilton OR verstappen

AND aj OR spolu (v Lucene treba zátvorky, inak parser všetko zmení na AND):

(female AND american) OR (female AND italian)
(ferrari OR maserati) AND italian

Range (nad rokom narodenia, born_year, funguje len v PyLucene; hranice sú vrátane):

born_year:[1950 TO 1960]
ferrari AND born_year:[1930 TO 1939]
italian AND born_year:[1940 TO 1949]

Phrase (slová musia stáť vedľa seba v tom istom poli, funguje len v PyLucene):

"red bull"
"formula one"
"le mans"
"formula one" AND italian